WEBVTT

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.217
Let's connect Instagram to Recatch.

00:00:03.287 --> 00:00:05.409
Instagram connects through a Facebook

00:00:05.409 --> 00:00:06.842
Page, using your own Meta

00:00:06.842 --> 00:00:07.780
app for now.

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:09.842
Step one. Create your

00:00:09.842 --> 00:00:12.021
account at recatch.app.

00:00:12.091 --> 00:00:13.928
On the Create your workspace

00:00:13.928 --> 00:00:15.831
screen, enter your name, your

00:00:15.831 --> 00:00:17.405
email, and a password of

00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:19.099
at least 8 characters.

00:00:19.169 --> 00:00:20.649
Then click Create account.

00:00:20.949 --> 00:00:21.970
Step two. You land

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.525
on the Channels screen.

00:00:23.595 --> 00:00:25.977
Under Connect a channel, click Instagram.

00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:28.653
Step three. In Meta for Developers,

00:00:28.653 --> 00:00:30.668
add Instagram to your app.

00:00:30.738 --> 00:00:32.945
Connect your Instagram professional account

00:00:32.945 --> 00:00:34.170
to a Facebook Page.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:36.494
Then generate a Page access token

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:41.318
with the instagram_manage_messages and pages_messaging permissions.

00:00:41.388 --> 00:00:43.622
These values are fake examples.

00:00:43.622 --> 00:00:45.567
Never share your real token

00:00:45.567 --> 00:00:46.826
or app secret.

00:00:47.126 --> 00:00:49.392
Step four. Paste the Facebook Page

00:00:49.392 --> 00:00:51.574
ID and the Page access token.

00:00:51.644 --> 00:00:54.192
Adding your App secret is recommended.

00:00:54.192 --> 00:00:57.056
It's used to verify webhook signatures.

00:00:57.356 --> 00:00:59.631
Step five. Click Connect account.

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:02.243
Recatch now shows a Callback URL

00:01:02.243 --> 00:01:04.483
and a Verify token, under Paste

00:01:04.483 --> 00:01:06.756
into the Meta App dashboard.

00:01:07.056 --> 00:01:08.782
Step six. Paste both into

00:01:08.782 --> 00:01:11.130
your app's Instagram webhooks, and

00:01:11.130 --> 00:01:14.556
subscribe to messages and messaging_postbacks.

00:01:14.856 --> 00:01:17.338
That's it. Instagram is connected.

00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:19.160
Next, build your first flow,

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:21.225
from the lead-capture template or

00:01:21.225 --> 00:01:22.414
a blank canvas.
